# Blix's own project: the engine, its tools, and the suites that judge it.
blix

# What `blix test` runs here. One ordered gate replaces seven invocations and
# seven outputs that a person would otherwise have to reconcile by hand.
test: Blix.Test.Graphics, Blix.Test.Diagnostics, Blix.Test.Physics2D, Blix.Test.Physics3D, Blix.Test.Apps, Blix.Test.Studio, Blix.Test.Recipes
